---
layout: layouts/base.njk
lang: en
title: Outdoor Furniture in Egypt
permalink: /en/
description: "Nestica outdoor furniture in Egypt: seating sets, umbrellas, swings and dining sets for gardens, rooftops, terraces and balconies, with customization options and real delivery photos."
preloadImage: /assets/images/new-hero.webp
image: /assets/images/new-hero.webp
---
{% set offerProducts = products | offers %}{% set featuredProducts = products | featured %}
<section class="hero-section"><div class="container"><div class="hero-content"><span class="hero-kicker">Nestica Outdoor Furniture</span><h1>Outdoor Furniture for Gardens, Rooftops and Balconies in Egypt</h1><p>Outdoor seating sets, umbrellas, swings and dining sets with multiple size and color options, supported by real delivery photos.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a href="{{ '/products/' | localeUrl('en') | url }}" class="btn btn-warning btn-lg">Browse Outdoor Furniture</a><a href="{{ '/real-deliveries/' | localeUrl('en') | url }}" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg">View Real Deliveries</a><a href="https://wa.me/{{ settings.whatsapp | replace('+','') }}?text={{ 'I would like to send a photo of my space and get an outdoor furniture recommendation' | urlencode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-light btn-lg" onclick="trackWhatsappLead('home_hero_space_en')"><i class="bi bi-whatsapp"></i> Send Your Space Photo</a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="trust-strip" aria-label="Nestica benefits"><div class="container"><div class="row g-3 text-center"><div class="col-md-3 col-6"><i class="bi bi-sun"></i><strong>Outdoor</strong><span>Materials and designs for outdoor spaces</span></div><div class="col-md-3 col-6"><i class="bi bi-rulers"></i><strong>Custom</strong><span>Model-specific sizes and colors</span></div><div class="col-md-3 col-6"><i class="bi bi-camera"></i><strong>Real</strong><span>Photos from actual customer deliveries</span></div><div class="col-md-3 col-6"><i class="bi bi-whatsapp"></i><strong>Support</strong><span>Questions and order follow-up on WhatsApp</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="container section-space real-deliveries-preview"><div class="section-heading d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-end gap-3"><div><span class="section-kicker">Real Work</span><h2>Nestica Furniture in Real Spaces</h2><p>See seating, dining sets and umbrellas after delivery inside actual outdoor spaces.</p></div><a href="{{ '/real-deliveries/' | localeUrl('en') | url }}" class="btn btn-outline-dark rounded-pill">All Deliveries <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a></div><div class="row g-4">{% for delivery in deliveries %}{% if delivery.is_featured %}<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6"><a href="{{ '/real-deliveries/' | localeUrl('en') | url }}#delivery-{{ delivery.id }}" class="delivery-preview-card"><img src="{{ delivery.image | url }}" alt="{{ delivery.alt_en }}" width="{{ delivery.image_width }}" height="{{ delivery.image_height }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div class="delivery-preview-overlay"><span>{{ delivery.space_name_en }}</span><h3>{{ delivery.title_en }}</h3>{% if delivery.price %}<small>{% if delivery.price_is_estimate %}Approx. {% endif %}{{ delivery.price | egp }}</small>{% endif %}</div></a></div>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="category-showcase section-space"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading text-center"><span class="section-kicker">Choose a Category</span><h2>Everything You Need for Your Outdoor Space</h2><p>Browse by material or product type and compare designs and base prices.</p></div><div class="row g-4">{% for category in categories %}{% if category.is_active != false %}<div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-6">{% include "components/category-card.njk" %}</div>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></div></section>
{% if featuredProducts.length %}<section class="container section-space"><div class="section-heading d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-end gap-3"><div><span class="section-kicker">Nestica Picks</span><h2>Products Worth Exploring</h2><p>A selected group of current designs and offers.</p></div><a class="btn btn-outline-dark rounded-pill" href="{{ '/products/' | localeUrl('en') | url }}">All Products</a></div><div class="row g-4">{% for product in featuredProducts | limit(8) %}<div class="col-xl-3 col-md-6">{% include "components/product-card.njk" %}</div>{% endfor %}</div></section>{% endif %}
{% if offerProducts.length %}<section class="offers-home section-space"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-end gap-3"><div><span class="section-kicker">Limited Time</span><h2>Current Nestica Offers</h2><p>Discounts on selected products. Review each offer before ordering.</p></div><a class="btn btn-warning rounded-pill fw-bold" href="{{ '/offers/' | localeUrl('en') | url }}">View All Offers</a></div><div class="offers-slider-wrapper"><button type="button" class="offers-nav" id="offersPrev" onclick="scrollOffers(-1)" aria-label="Previous offer">‹</button><div class="offers-slider" id="offersSlider">{% for product in offerProducts | limit(10) %}<div class="home-offer-item">{% include "components/product-card.njk" %}</div>{% endfor %}</div><button type="button" class="offers-nav" id="offersNext" onclick="scrollOffers(1)" aria-label="Next offer">›</button></div></div></section>{% endif %}
<section class="container section-space"><div class="section-heading text-center"><span class="section-kicker">Shop by Space</span><h2>Choose Furniture for Your Space</h2><p>Start with the location and use before choosing the model.</p></div><div class="row g-4">{% for space in spaces %}{% set spaceProducts = products | inSpace(space.slug) %}<div class="col-lg col-md-4 col-6"><a href="{{ ('/spaces/' + space.slug + '/') | localeUrl('en') | url }}" class="space-card-box"><div class="space-card-img-wrap"><img src="{{ space.image | url }}" alt="{{ space.name_en }} by Nestica" width="{{ space.image_width }}" height="{{ space.image_height }}" loading="lazy"></div><div class="space-card-content"><h3>{{ space.name_en }}</h3><span>{{ spaceProducts.length }} products</span></div></a></div>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="why-section section-space"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading text-center"><span class="section-kicker">Why Nestica?</span><h2>A Clearer Choice Before Production</h2><p>Compare specifications, view real deliveries and share your space details before confirming.</p></div><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6"><div class="why-feature-card"><i class="bi bi-images"></i><h3>Real Photos</h3><p>Actual deliveries showing furniture in different spaces.</p></div></div><div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6"><div class="why-feature-card"><i class="bi bi-grid-1x2"></i><h3>Wide Selection</h3><p>Metal, wood, rattan, rope, dining sets, umbrellas and swings.</p></div></div><div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6"><div class="why-feature-card"><i class="bi bi-pencil-square"></i><h3>Custom Notes</h3><p>Add dimensions or color requests for confirmation.</p></div></div><div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6"><div class="why-feature-card"><i class="bi bi-chat-square-text"></i><h3>Direct Contact</h3><p>Ask about products and available options directly on WhatsApp.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="container section-space guides-preview"><div class="section-heading d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-end gap-3"><div><span class="section-kicker">Before You Buy</span><h2>Outdoor Furniture Buying Guides</h2><p>Practical answers about materials, dimensions, umbrellas and space planning.</p></div><a href="{{ '/guides/' | localeUrl('en') | url }}" class="btn btn-outline-dark rounded-pill">All Guides</a></div><div class="row g-4">{% for guide in guides | limit(3) %}<div class="col-lg-4"><a class="guide-card" href="{{ ('/guides/' + guide.slug + '/') | localeUrl('en') | url }}"><img src="{{ guide.hero_image | url }}" alt="{{ guide.title_en }}" width="{{ guide.image_width }}" height="{{ guide.image_height }}" loading="lazy"><div><span>Nestica Guide</span><h3>{{ guide.title_en }}</h3><p>{{ guide.summary_en }}</p></div></a></div>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="container section-space conversion-guide"><div class="row g-4 align-items-center"><div class="col-lg-5"><span class="section-kicker">How to Order</span><h2>From Product Selection to Final Confirmation</h2><p>Choose a product, add your notes and send the request on WhatsApp. The team will confirm availability, customization and delivery.</p></div><div class="col-lg-7"><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-md-4"><div class="step-card"><span>01</span><h3>Choose a Product</h3><p>Browse by category or space.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="step-card"><span>02</span><h3>Add Your Notes</h3><p>Dimensions, color and space photo.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="step-card"><span>03</span><h3>Confirm on WhatsApp</h3><p>Review details and delivery before production.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="container section-space faq-section"><div class="section-heading text-center"><span class="section-kicker">FAQ</span><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p>Direct answers to help you start.</p></div><div class="accordion faq-accordion" id="homeFaqEn">{% set faqs=[{'q':'Are Nestica products suitable for outdoor use?','a':'Products are presented for outdoor spaces. Materials, treatment and care instructions vary by model.'},{'q':'Can dimensions or colors be changed?','a':'Selected models support customization. Send your measurements or a space photo for confirmation.'},{'q':'How do I know whether a product fits my space?','a':'Measure the usable area and circulation paths, then browse by space or send approximate dimensions to Nestica.'},{'q':'Do prices include delivery and customization?','a':'Displayed prices are base product prices. Delivery and modifications are confirmed before ordering.'},{'q':'How do I order?','a':'Open the product page and contact Nestica directly, or add products to the cart and send the full request on WhatsApp.'}] %}{% for faq in faqs %}<div class="accordion-item"><h3 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button {% if not loop.first %}collapsed{% endif %}" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq-en-{{ loop.index }}">{{ faq.q }}</button></h3><div id="faq-en-{{ loop.index }}" class="accordion-collapse collapse {% if loop.first %}show{% endif %}" data-bs-parent="#homeFaqEn"><div class="accordion-body">{{ faq.a }}</div></div></div>{% endfor %}</div></section>
